      "raw": "<p>Greetings, intrepid intreppers! &nbsp;And welcome to the&nbsp;<em><strong>most important personality quiz ever!</strong></em>&nbsp;&nbsp;(Question submissions accepted)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b><i><u>Which Prime Aspect is Yours?</u></i></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1.) You see a young woman snatch an old man’s wallet on the street and run off. &nbsp;What do you do?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>a. Punch the old man and steal the rest of his stuff.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>b. Steal the wallet from the woman and remove all the money before returning it with a very public Facebook post.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>c. Take the wallet back and return it, so that things are returned to normal.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>d. Announce loudly that the old man is trying to steal the young woman’s money, and watch the ensuing chaos.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>e. Take the wallet back and return it, to ensure a brighter future for mankind.</p>",
